<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46348" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῠγόω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζυγόν</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>yoke, join together</i>,
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέλη</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.84
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. κιθάραν</span>
			<i>put the cross-bar to</i> the lyre, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				7.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>DMar.</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κανόνες ἐζυγωμένοι δύο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agatho
					4.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				41.26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>close</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείλη ῥαφαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paul.Aeg.
					6.67
				</span></i>
			 (prob.); <i>shut off</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Cord.</u>
				12
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>bring under the yoke, subdue</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				115
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
